📘 Introduction to GitOps & ArgoCD
(GitOps आणि ArgoCD परिचय)
English:

GitOps is a modern DevOps practice where Git is the single source of truth for infrastructure and application deployment.
ArgoCD is a GitOps tool used to deploy applications on Kubernetes.

मराठी:

GitOps ही एक आधुनिक DevOps पद्धत आहे जिथे Git हे एकमेव source of truth असते.
ArgoCD हे Kubernetes मध्ये application deploy करण्यासाठी वापरले जाणारे GitOps tool आहे.

🔁 What is GitOps? – DVAO Principle
English:

GitOps follows DVAO:

D – Declarative: System state is defined in YAML files

V – Versioned: Everything is stored in Git

A – Automated: Changes are auto-applied

O – Observed: System continuously checks actual vs desired state

मराठी:

GitOps DVAO principle वर चालते:

D – Declarative: YAML फाइलमध्ये system state define

V – Versioned: सगळं Git मध्ये version control

A – Automated: बदल आपोआप apply होतात

O – Observed: Actual आणि desired state सतत compare होते

❓ What is GitOps?
English:

GitOps is a method where:

Git contains desired infrastructure & app state

Any change in Git = change in cluster

No manual kubectl commands needed

मराठी:

GitOps म्हणजे:

Infrastructure आणि app state Git मध्ये असते

Git मधील बदल म्हणजे cluster मधील बदल

Manual kubectl commands लागतात नाहीत

⚙️ How GitOps Works?
English:

Developer pushes code/YAML to Git

GitOps tool (ArgoCD/FluxCD) detects change

Tool syncs Git state with Kubernetes

Cluster matches Git automatically

मराठी:

Developer Git मध्ये code/YAML push करतो

GitOps tool बदल ओळखतो

Tool Kubernetes ला sync करतो

Cluster Git प्रमाणे update होतो

⚖️ GitOps vs Traditional CI/CD
GitOps	Traditional CI/CD
Git is source of truth	CI tool controls deploy
Pull-based	Push-based
More secure	Less secure
Auto rollback	Manual rollback
मराठी:
GitOps	Traditional CI/CD
Git एकमेव source	CI tool deploy करतो
Pull model	Push model
जास्त secure	कमी secure
Auto rollback	Manual rollback
🚀 What is ArgoCD?
English:

ArgoCD is:

A Kubernetes-native GitOps tool

Monitors Git repo

Syncs Kubernetes automatically

मराठी:

ArgoCD:

Kubernetes साठी GitOps tool

Git repo monitor करतो

Kubernetes auto sync करतो

🤔 Why ArgoCD?
English:

We use ArgoCD because:

Automatic deployment

Easy rollback

UI + CLI support

Secure (no direct cluster access)

मराठी:

ArgoCD वापरण्याचे कारण:

Automatic deployment

सोपा rollback

UI आणि CLI

जास्त security

🔄 How ArgoCD Works?
English:

ArgoCD connects to Git repo

Reads Kubernetes manifests

Compares desired vs actual state

Syncs cluster automatically

मराठी:

ArgoCD Git repo connect करतो

YAML files वाचतो

Desired आणि actual state compare करतो

Cluster auto update करतो

